[executive]
# ============================================================================
# O_o_Reader test model: plate radiating through acoustic infinite elements
#
# Covers:
#   - cards: CACINF3, CACINF4, PACINF, ACIFPRM
#   - solution: SOL 108 (direct frequency response, coupled fluid and
#     structure, unbounded fluid)
#   - outputs: complex displacements and fluid pressures, plate stresses
#     and forces, fluid element pressures
# Run notes:
#   - a clamped steel plate (200 x 200 x 1 mm, z = 0) under an air box
#     (z 0 to 100) whose top and sides carry conjugate infinite elements
#     (pole at the plate centre); the plate plane is a rigid baffle
#   - one top cell of the box is two CPENTA, for the triangular CACINF3
# Written for this project, to exercise the reader.
# How to run it, what to bring back: validation/models/README.md.
# ============================================================================
SolutionSequence;108
[case]
TitleText;O_o_Reader test model: infinite elements (SOL 108)
BulkEcho;None
SinglePointConstrSelection;1
DynamicLoadSelection;21
FreqSetSelection;41
SetDefinition;1;101;Through;116
DisplacementOutput;All;PlotOnly
StressOutput;1;PlotOnly
ElemForceOutput;All;PlotOnly
SubcaseStart;1
LabelText;plate driven at (50, 50), free field above
